<urn:atm:triage:finding/AV4-B1>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AV4-B1" ;
  triage:title "Freeze-exception bound (D6/A6) violated: read_benchmark.py is a forked parallel harness, not additive family registration" ;
  triage:description "scripts/smoke/read_benchmark.py imports nothing from the existing send-message-benchmark infrastructure and reimplements what D6 requires be reused: (a) second baseline/ratchet engine load_read_baselines/ratchet_floor (:182-231) with new read_families JSON shape and max(prior, min3*(1-5%)) auto-ratchet vs benchmark_schema.py BaselineSet/BaselineEntry with approved_by/effective_from provenance and require_non_decreasing_baselines(); (b) second report renderer/envelope render_report/execute (:466-532, :606-612) duplicating benchmark_report.py compose()/render_envelope() and never calling regenerate_index(); (c) divergent percentile() (:130-138) vs benchmark_schema.percentile/distribution; (d) ad hoc pass/fail instead of benchmark_policy.classify_status(). Remediation: rework onto existing primitives (family discriminator, name-level extension). Source: quality-mgr phase-av-sprint-av4-qa-r1, PR #1114 report; consolidates ARCH-AV4-1, RBQA-AV4-1/2/3." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-av" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "AV4" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-08-31T03:10:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
